            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Phú Lâm",
            "review_text": "Peter Salt\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nGreat food with a smile\nOct 2025 • Couples\nIn Hanoi overnight and searched for good Chinese food and Phu Lam was just 300m from our hotel. Absolutely great food and service, every dish was just perfect and the smiles from the staff made our evening. See you again next trip.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 10, 2025",
